{"id": "86264", "name": "אסימפטוטה משופעת של פונקציה רציונלית (באנגלית)", "defaultgrade": 1, "penalty": 0, "options": {"multiplicationsign": "dot", "complexno": "i", "matrixparens": "[", "inversetrig": "cos-1", "logicsymbol": "lang", "sqrtsign": true}, "nhints": 0, "questiontext": "<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"background:#F4F1F5;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px\"><p>Find the equation of the oblique asymptote to the graph of the rational function</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ f(x)=\\frac{{CT:0}}{{CT:1}} \\]</p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:14px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><div style=\"background:#FAF9FB;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate\">\\(y = \\) [[input:ans1]]</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\">[[validation:ans1]]</div><p style=\"font-size:0.92em;margin:8px 0 0\">Enter your answer as a*{{CT:2}} + b.</p></div></div>", "generalfeedback": "<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"background:#F4F1F5;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:12px 16px;margin-bottom:12px\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">Outline:</b> Divide the numerator by the denominator; the quotient is the asymptote.</div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">Step 1 — Polynomial division</b><br>To find the equation of the oblique asymptote to the graph of the rational function<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ f(x)=\\frac{{CT:0}}{{CT:1}} \\]</p>divide the numerator by the denominator. The numerator has degree 4 and the denominator degree 3, so the quotient is linear. Dividing gives quotient <span dir=\"ltr\">\\({{CT:3}}\\)</span> and remainder <span dir=\"ltr\">\\({{CT:4}}\\)</span>:<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ {{CT:0}}=\\left({{CT:3}}\\right)\\left({{CT:1}}\\right)+\\left({{CT:4}}\\right) \\]</p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">Step 2 — The asymptote</b><br>Therefore<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ f(x)={{CT:3}}+\\frac{{CT:4}}{{CT:1}} \\]</p>The remainder has degree 2, lower than the degree 3 of the denominator, so <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\frac{{CT:4}}{{CT:1}}\\to 0\\)</span> as <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(x\\to\\pm\\infty\\)</span>: the difference between <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(f(x)\\)</span> and the line tends to 0. The oblique asymptote is therefore<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ y = {{CT:5}} \\]</p></div></div>", "specificfeedback": "<p>[[feedback:Result]]</p>", "prtcorrect": "<p><span class=\"correct\">Correct answer, well done.</span></p>", "prtpartiallycorrect": "<p><span class=\"partially\">Your answer is partially correct.</span></p>", "prtincorrect": "<p><span class=\"incorrect\">Incorrect answer.</span></p>", "inputs": [{"name": "ans1", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 20, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "diff", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}], "prts": [{"name": "Result", "value": 1, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans1", "tans": "correctanswer", "testoptions": "v", "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 1, "penalty": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "Result-0-T ", "feedback": ""}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "penalty": 0, "nextnode": 1, "answernote": "Result-0-F ", "feedback": ""}}, {"name": 1, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans1", "tans": "wronganswer1", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "penalty": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "Result-1-T ", "feedback": ""}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "penalty": 0, "nextnode": 2, "answernote": "Result-1-F ", "feedback": ""}}, {"name": 2, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans1", "tans": "wronganswer2", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "penalty": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "Result-2-T ", "feedback": ""}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "penalty": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "Result-2-F ", "feedback": ""}}]}], "qvnames": ["correctanswer", "p2", "p3", "p4", "r", "v", "wronganswer1", "wronganswer2"], "nvariants": 50}